repository-code: 'https://github.com/microbiome/multiomics-lesson'
url: 'https://microbiome.github.io/multiomics-lesson/'
abstract: >-
  A Carpentries-style lesson on integrating microbiome data with other
  data types, such as metabolites and host biomarkers, measured from the
  same samples, for learners who can already analyse a single microbiome
  table. Learners store several
  data types in a MultiAssayExperiment and apply exploratory (Mantel test,
  MiRKAT, pairwise association), unsupervised (joint RPCA, MOFA) and
  supervised (IntegratedLearner, DIABLO) integration methods with
  R/Bioconductor.
keywords:
  - microbiome
  - multi-omics
  - data integration
  - Bioconductor
